## Confirmed Focus Areas

After reviewing your work with CEO Anne Hastings, Comm360 will focus on this subset of causes:

 - Trauma — domestic violence, family conflict, or untreated mental health conditions — leading to housing insecurity
 - Limited economic opportunity and restrictive labor-market conditions
 - Racial discrimination in housing and lending markets
 - Limited access to cash assistance or income-support programs
 - Unsheltered people facing increased risks from extreme heat or severe weather
